{"id": "sonnet__GEN__omni_1790__1", "result": "Factor step by step:\n\n101101101101 = 101 \u00d7 1001001001, since 1001001001 \u00d7 101 = 100100100100 + 1001001001 = 101101101101.\n\nNext, 1001001001 = 1 + x + x\u00b2 + x\u00b3 with x = 1000, which equals (1 + x)(1 + x\u00b2) = 1001 \u00d7 1000001.\n\n- 1001 = 7 \u00d7 11 \u00d7 13.\n- 1000001 = 101 \u00d7 9901, and 9901 is prime.\n\nSo 101101101101 = 7 \u00d7 11 \u00d7 13 \u00d7 101 \u00d7 101 \u00d7 9901, and the largest prime factor is 9901.\n\nANSWER: 9901", "rc": 0, "cost": 0.0075750999999999995, "model_used": ["claude-sonnet-5-5"], "secs": 10.1}